hamsterdan-github
Copyright 2026 Seasoned

This package is a Haskell port of Hamsterdan's GitHub App boundary:
configuration, webhooks, authentication and the typed GitHub client from
Hamsterdan (https://github.com/henriquebastos/hamsterdan), pinned under
upstream/hamsterdan (see UPSTREAM.md at the repository root). It reproduces
the observable behaviour of that reference, and its test suite ports the
reference's tests and runs differential checks against it.

